    <string name="about_network_title">Network access</string>
    <string name="about_network_summary">The app declares one network permission, for update checks, and Android grants it at install time — INTERNET is a normal permission with no runtime prompt. It stays unused until you turn on update checks in Settings: that switch is off by default, and with it off no request is made. Nothing else in the app connects to anything, and no photo, video, index or review mark is ever uploaded.</string>
